# Large vendored binaries.
#
# These two files are committed artefacts we do not build here (see
# docs/provenance.md): the prebuilt upstream WASM client and the Saki card art.
# They are tracked through Git LFS so that *future* edits stop growing the
# repository. History is deliberately NOT rewritten — the blobs committed before
# this file are still ordinary git objects, so an existing clone is unaffected
# and no force-push is needed. See docs/known-issues.md KI-08.
web-client/public/images/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
server/public/*.wasm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
